{"ref":"2023.CC5.3","summary":"Pursuant to section 170(2) of the City of Toronto Act, 2006 (COTA), the Ombudsman has concluded the report about its Investigation into the City's Processes for Clearing Encampments in 2021. We hereby table with City Council for its March 29, 2023 session the Investigation Report, dated March 24, 2023.","decided":"City Council on March 29, 30 and 31, 2023, adopted the following: 1. City Council accept the report from Ombudsman Toronto and direct City Officials to implement the report's recommendations. Ombudsman Toronto's Recommendations: 1. The City should ensure that the City division or group tasked with clearing encampments is properly resourced, has the required social services expertise needed to properly support people living in encampments, and works collaboratively with divisional partners. 2. The City should ensure that, if it decides it is necessary to clear an encampment, it prioritizes the needs of those living in the encampment, including providing vital social services to help with the transition. 3. The City should create a detailed plan outlining how the City will support access to physical and mental health services for those living in encampments. 4. The City should create a strategy for engaging with people living in encampments, including specific strategies for Indigenous communities, as well as Black, racialized, and equity-deserving groups. These strategies should include a clear definition of engagement. They should also seek and incorporate feedback from people living in encampments. 5. The City should proactively work to repair its relationships with community workers for the benefit of those living in encampments. 6. The City should provide the public with…","motions":[{"stage":"City Council","when":"2023-03-31 17:07 PM","desc":"Majority required - CC5.3 - Matlow - motion 5c","type":"Amend Motion","result":"Lost, 11-12","yes":11,"no":12,"votes":[["Alejandra Bravo","Yes"],["Amber Morley","Yes"],["Anthony Perruzza","Yes"],["Ausma Malik","Yes"],["Chris Moise","Yes"],["Gord Perks","Yes"],["Jamaal Myers","Yes"],["Josh Matlow","Yes"],["Nick Mantas","Yes"],["Paul Ainslie","Yes"],["Paula Fletcher","Yes"],["Brad Bradford","No"],["Dianne Saxe","No"],["Frances Nunziata","No"],["Gary Crawford","No"],["Jaye Robinson","No"],["Jennifer McKelvie","No"],["Jon Burnside","No"],["Michael Thompson","No"],["Mike Colle","No"],["Shelley Carroll","No"],["Stephen Holyday","No"],["Vincent Crisanti","No"],["James Pasternak","Absent"],["Lily Cheng","Absent"]]},{"stage":"City Council","when":"2023-03-31 17:09 PM","desc":"Majority required - CC5.3 - Holyday - motion 4","type":"Amend Item","result":"Lost, 3-20","yes":3,"no":20,"votes":[["Jon Burnside","Yes"],["Nick Mantas","Yes"],["Stephen Holyday","Yes"],["Alejandra Bravo","No"],["Amber Morley","No"],["Anthony Perruzza","No"],["Ausma Malik","No"],["Brad Bradford","No"],["Chris Moise","No"],["Dianne Saxe","No"],["Frances Nunziata","No"],["Gary Crawford","No"],["Gord Perks","No"],["Jamaal Myers","No"],["Jaye Robinson","No"],["Jennifer McKelvie","No"],["Josh Matlow","No"],["Michael Thompson","No"],["Mike Colle","No"],["Paul Ainslie","No"],["Paula Fletcher","No"],["Shelley Carroll","No"],["Vincent Crisanti","No"],["James Pasternak","Absent"],["Lily Cheng","Absent"]]},{"stage":"City Council","when":"2023-03-31 17:10 PM","desc":"Majority required - CC5.3 - Matlow - motion 5a","type":"Amend Motion","result":"Lost, 9-14","yes":9,"no":14,"votes":[["Alejandra Bravo","Yes"],["Amber Morley","Yes"],["Ausma Malik","Yes"],["Chris Moise","Yes"],["Gord Perks","Yes"],["Jamaal Myers","Yes"],["Josh Matlow","Yes"],["Paul Ainslie","Yes"],["Paula Fletcher","Yes"],["Anthony Perruzza","No"],["Brad Bradford","No"],["Dianne Saxe","No"],["Frances Nunziata","No"],["Gary Crawford","No"],["Jaye Robinson","No"],["Jennifer McKelvie","No"],["Jon Burnside","No"],["Michael Thompson","No"],["Mike Colle","No"],["Nick Mantas","No"],["Shelley Carroll","No"],["Stephen Holyday","No"],["Vinc